          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "افواہ (afvāh) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic afwāh, \"mouths\": what passes from mouth to mouth. It is feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
